                "description": "Baldwin CUR-TRR, Curve Lever with Traditional Round Rose - The Curve Lever with Traditional Round Rose features a classic silhouette known as the wave design. It is one of the most popular styles of levers because of its elegance and timelessness. The Curve Lever will fit doors 1-3/8 inches thick to 2-1/2 inches thick with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. Choose from a keyed entry, passage, privacy, or dummy functions.",
